      "Is Lexkite really 100% free?": "q[0]",
      "Yes. There are no paywalls, hidden credit card forms, or \"hearts\" lockouts that stop your practice. All core drills, spaced repetition decks, and the browser extension remain entirely open to all learners worldwide.": "q[1]"
     }
